// Causal block-sparse attention, one CTA per (query block, query head).
//
//   out[b,h,qb*128 + r, :] = sum_slots softmax_j( q.k_j / sqrt(D) ) v_j
//
// Mask: slot s of (b,h,qb) holds block id ids[b,h,qb,s]; its keys sit at global
// token t = id*128 + c and count iff slot < count and t <= qb*128 + r.  Ids below
// qb are fully open, id == qb keeps c <= r, anything else drops out and is skipped.
//
// Scores are q.k/sqrt(D) over unit-variance bf16 operands, so exp2(s) stays well
// inside fp32 range without max subtraction; softmax becomes a plain normalised sum.
// Per slot: K/V double buffered, ldmatrix issued one step early, the S phase of the
